## Context
Once both Padme and OpenRouter workers are operational, the Makefile
sweep targets (or_rule, padme_rule, foreach loops) are replaced by
the experiment manager + worker pipeline. gh#75 (API key guard) becomes
moot since workers manage their own credentials.

## Actions
1. Replace experiments/Makefile sweep targets with manager calls
   e.g. `sweep1: python -m aedist.manager generate sweeps/sweep1_census.yaml`
2. Keep summary/reporting targets (they read measurements table)
3. Update `make help` text
4. Verify gh#75 is no longer relevant

## Exit criteria
- `python -m aedist.manager generate` + `python -m aedist.worker` can
  execute a full sweep end-to-end
- Makefile foreach macro expansion removed
- make help reflects new workflow
- All tests pass
